                <h5>What Can You Do Here?</h5>
                <p style="padding: 2px;">Trace your roots for <strong><a href="faq_05.html#five">FREE</a></strong> with our searchable database containing thousands of identified and mystery photos for genealogy enthusiasts looking for long-lost family. Anyone who finds a photo of a direct ancestor that is owned by the archive will receive the photo for <a href="faq_05.html#five">free</a>.
                <br><br>If the historic photos you find pique your interest in genealogy, you can continue your research by doing a <a href="https://www.familysearch.org/discovery/explore/" target="_blank">family search</a> here.<br>
                </p>
                <h5>Archive Tips</h5>
<p><b>Posting Your Photos:</b><br>Adding keywords to the comments field when posting photos to the archive makes them more easily found by other researchers. Who knows, you may make a connection based on your brilliant keyword choices!</p>            <!-- <div style="background-color: #ebebeb; padding: 8px;">
